{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "882b8ac2-e2b5-8360-84e9-ffa2037f443c",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T14:59:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Fernando Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:55:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Happy almost New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:55:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Yes, hello. My name is Fernando Pacheco. I'm calling about standing water in the road, in front of fifty-two Callender Avenue, in the North End. Sorry, hang on, I'm at the sink, I'm doing dishes. I'll try to keep the faucet from drowning me out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:56:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, I can hear you fine. Standing water, so is this from the rain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:56:20-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the thing, no. It hasn't rained in three days. Well, let me be exact. The last real rain was Sunday morning, and it's Wednesday afternoon, so three days, yeah. And there's still a puddle across about half the road. It's just sitting there at the storm drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:56:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So the drain is right in front of your place?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:56:45-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Almost. It's at the edge of the curb, maybe two houses down toward the corner, but it's on my side of the street. I own the house at fifty-two, I rent out both units. My tenants are driving through it and it's spraying up on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:57:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Have you noticed anything on the grate, leaves, trash, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:57:11-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. This morning, around eight, I went out and cleared the leaves off the grate by hand. Wet leaves, a lot of them, packed in there. And it did help. The water started going down. But that lasted maybe ten minutes, and then it backed up again. So it's not just the leaves. Something is blocked underneath, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:57:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be my guess too, if it drains and then stops. Sounds like something farther down the line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I'll be honest, this isn't the first time I've noticed it being slow there. It's been going on a while and nobody has looked at it. I'd just like somebody to actually come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I can put in a work order for a crew to inspect the drain. Let me get the address again, fifty-two Callender Avenue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-two Callender Avenue, yes. Though to be precise, the drain itself is closer to the neighbor's, but that's the house number to use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, I'll note it's near fifty-two, toward the corner. And a number for you, in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:58:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:58:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-six. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:58:34-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, will the work order actually be opened today? And what date should I expect somebody? I'd like a date, not just soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It'll be opened as soon as we hang up, so today, the thirty-first. As for when the crew gets there, with the holiday tomorrow I'd say you're looking at the first few days of next week, maybe sooner. It depends how the schedule falls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So that's, what, Monday, Tuesday? The fifth or sixth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:59:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Somewhere in that window, yes. If it gets worse before then, or the water starts reaching the houses, call back and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:59:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. I'd appreciate that. And I'm writing down that I called today at, uh, about three in the afternoon, just for my own records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:59:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Three o'clock, December thirty-first. You're all set, Mr. Pacheco."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Denise. Happy New Year."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T14:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
